 jué</span>\n        <span class=\"hz\">千山鸟飞绝，</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"line\">\n        <span class=\"py\">wàn jìng rén zōng miè</span>\n        <span class=\"hz\">万径人踪灭。</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"line\">\n        <span class=\"py\">gū zhōu suō lì wēng</span>\n        <span class=\"hz\">孤舟蓑笠翁，</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"line\">\n        <span class=\"py\">dú diào hán jiāng xuě</span>\n        <span class=\"hz\">独钓寒江雪 。</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"trans-block\">\n      <span class=\"trans-label\">译文:</span>\n      <div class=\"trans-text\">\n        群山之间，没有一只鸟儿飞过。纵横的小路上，见不到行人的踪迹。只有一位身披蓑衣、头戴笠帽的渔翁，架着小船，冒着风雪，在寒冷的江上独自垂钓。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
